 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "执行模型，是一条链怎么存状态，怎么调用程序，怎么决定谁能改什么。",
   "spoken": "执行模型，是一条链怎么存状态，怎么掉用程序，怎么决定谁能改什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 9.697
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "漏洞的本质，在哪条链上都一样。",
   "spoken": "漏洞的本质，在哪条链上都一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.728,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 10.826,
   "speechEnd": 13.23
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "程序相信了一个不该相信的输入。",
   "spoken": "程序相信了一个不该相信的输入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.284,
   "dur": 3.024,
   "speechStart": 14.382,
   "speechEnd": 16.477
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "变的，是输入的样子。",
   "spoken": "变的，是输入的样子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 17.528,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 17.626,
   "speechEnd": 19.387
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "在 EVM 上，合约拥有自己的存储，攻击者换不掉它。输入是参数和外部调用。",
   "spoken": "在 EVM 上，合约拥有自己的存储，攻击者换不掉它。输入是参数和外部掉用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 20.46,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 20.558,
   "speechEnd": 27.055
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "在 Solana 上，程序本身不存状态。账户全部由调用者传进来。",
   "spoken": "在 Solana 上，程序本身不存状态。账户全部由掉用者传进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.12,
   "dur": 5.976,
   "speechStart": 28.218,
   "speechEnd": 33.263
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "在 Move 上，状态是带类型的对象。输入是对象，风险常在数学库和权限。",
   "spoken": "在 Move 上，状态是带类型的对象。输入是对象，风险常在数学库和权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.316,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 34.414,
   "speechEnd": 40.911
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "在 Bitcoin 上，链只记录交易。铭文这类资产的余额，由链下的索引器解释。",
   "spoken": "在 Bitcoin 上，链只记录交易。铭文这类资产的余额，由链下的索引器解释。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 41.976,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 42.074,
   "speechEnd": 47.928
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "在 Cosmos 上，各条应用链用 IBC，验证对方链上的状态。",
   "spoken": "在 Cosmos 上，各条应用链用 IBC，验证对方链上的状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.988,
   "dur": 5.4,
   "speechStart": 49.086,
   "speechEnd": 53.538
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 54.608,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 54.706,
   "speechEnd": 55.491
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "五个国家的海关，都要防走私。",
   "spoken": "五个国家的海关，都要防走私。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 56.7,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 56.798,
   "speechEnd": 59.0
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "EVM 查行李，Solana 查护照，Move 给每件货物贴防伪芯片。",
   "spoken": "EVM 查型李，Solana 查护照，Move 给每件货物贴防伪芯片。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 60.04,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 60.138,
   "speechEnd": 65.007
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "Bitcoin 只查集装箱的封条，不管里面装什么。Cosmos 和邻国互认海关章。",
   "spoken": "Bitcoin 只查集装箱的封条，不管里面装什么。Cosmos 和邻国互认海关章。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 66.068,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 66.166,
   "speechEnd": 72.092
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "走私者在每个国家，都找最薄弱的那一环。",
   "spoken": "走私者在每个国家，都找最博弱的那一环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 73.152,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 73.25,
   "speechEnd": 76.44
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的跨生态集成里，同一笔资产会经过好几个国家。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，真实的跨生态集成里，同一笔资产会经过好几个国家。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 77.5,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 77.598,
   "speechEnd": 83.61
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "每多一种模型，就多一组需要专门知识的检查项。",
   "spoken": "每多一种模型，就多一组需要专门知识的检查项。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 84.68,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 84.778,
   "speechEnd": 88.17
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
